              "text": "хороший (khoróshiy) — recorded from the 1200s. Vasmer thinks it most likely a short form of хоробрый, \"brave\"; a link with хоронить, \"to guard\", he finds less likely, and one with the sun god Khors, which Abaev later supported, he rejects."
